WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.860
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.980
I'm so excited!

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.980
Amano, you didn't forget your passport, right?

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.410
My passport?

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.440
My passport is right...

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.470
I was sure I put it in here!

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.700
This is strange... Where did it go?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.950
Ichigo, hurry up!

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:20.920
What?

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.940
If you don't hurry up, we're going to leave you here.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:24.870
Let's go.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.000
Wait!

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:35.010
We can't go to Paris anymore!?

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:44.140
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:44.140
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

