00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:48.350
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:53.690
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:53.690
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:58.240
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:58.240
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:00.410
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:00.410
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:04.880
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:13.000
Bonjour! Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.820
Wait, everyone!

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.770
Don't leave me behind!

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:22.290
Ichigo, wake up already!

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:23.960
Come on, Ichigo!

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:30.060
A dream?

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.670
Wake up already!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.960
I'm really...

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.290
Actually...

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:45.060
...in Paris!

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:51.080
recipe 40

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:51.080
Bonjour<i>!</i>  Paris

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:47.890
Bonjour! Paris.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.110
Good morning!

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:57.570
Good morning, Ichigo-chan.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:00.110
Wow! Awesome! It looks delicious!

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:05.370
So the one who slept like a log gets up the latest, huh?

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.100
We really should sleep a little...

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.880
How can you sleep, man?

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.040
We're going to Paris! Paris!

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:20.610
And if we win the World Cake Grand Prix, we'll be able to study at St. Marie's main campus in Paris!

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.890
Look at that!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.900
Tarte tatin...

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.890
Choux à la crème...

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.720
And macarons, s'il vous plaît...

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.100
S'il vous plaît...

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.770
I don't remember at all.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.450
That's very like you, Ichigo-chan.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.600
Anyway, let's eat before it gets cold.

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:40.780
Agreed!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:44.000
Starting tomorrow we'll take turns cooking.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.530
Oui, Monsieur!

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:49.450
There's a party the eve before the competition starting at 2 PM.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.790
Let's take a look around the Arc de Triomphe until then.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.150
If we take the subway...

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.290
That fragrant bittersweet aroma...

00:03:58.490 --> 00:03:59.750
Tarte tatin!

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:00.870
It looks delicious!

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:03.650
Hey, don't go spazzing out on your own.

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:04.800
But...

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.800
And this smell is... crêpes!

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:12.360
He flambéd it using grand marnier!

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:14.810
It's a crêpe suzette with caramel sauce on top!

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:17.790
No, the best is with ice cream and a chocolate sauce!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:22.030
And the smell of that coffee really enhances the flavour of the crêpe.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.320
I must eat it now!

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:26.330
After you ate the most breakfast?

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:28.680
Sweets go in a different stomach...

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:31.950
I found an èclair shop!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.270
That gelato looks delicious!

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:36.460
And the cakes here are so cute!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.840
And this cake shop is...

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:43.110
If we let you do what you want, we'll never get there.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.590
But...

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:46.590
There it is!

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.280
That's the metro station.

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.160
It's so awesome!

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:57.680
Not just the famous shops, but the entire city is filled with wonderful sweets!

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:00.570
It's like a treasure chest of sweets!

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.380
Let's pretend we don't know her.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:03.110
Yeah...

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:10.740
It's Paris, but I come here with my parents all the time...

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.680
I don't feel like doing any sightseeing now.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.750
I guess we have free time until the party.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:20.060
But your vacation house is quite something, Princess Mari.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:20.750
Thank you.

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:26.260
This place is equipped with a full set of cooking facilities, so we can make all the sweets we'd like.

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:29.550
I see you're already in battle mode, Princess Mari.

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.360
Obviously.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:34.640
The elite students from St. Marie all around the world have gathered.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.420
I wonder what kind of people they are?

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.330
Hey, we're getting off.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.380
Right...

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:00.930
Pardon!

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:02.240
I'm sorry!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.590
I'm getting off...

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:09.280
Huh? Huh?

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:18.800
We'll wait right here! Get off at the next station and come back!

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.260
Okay, I got it!

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:32.500
Everything'll be okay... I just have to get on one going the other direction.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:33.750
That's right!

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.350
Wait... does it look different from the station from before...

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:44.450
It's different!

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:45.380
But, why?

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:52.770
Uh... Maybe I got on a different subway line when I tried to go back?

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:57.060
This time I better get on the right one...

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:01.100
But which is where?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.430
Hi!

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:08.940
Buongiorno, signorina!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.260
I am Ricardo Benigni!

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.330
Please call me Rick.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.690
I'm Amano Ichigo.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:21.010
Ichigo! You are lost, aren't you?

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:22.040
You can tell?

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.970
Don't worry! Leave this to me.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.680
I have a strange feeling I've experienced this before...

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.590
Yeah...

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.580
Where are you taking me? Out from the station?

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:37.510
Don't worry, I'll escort you!

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:40.750
But before that I need to finish up my business.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.740
Ichigo, you're going to be kidnapped at this rate!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:46.820
This aroma...

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.860
This is why I came here!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.110
My favorite shop in Paris!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.780
Those are the crêpes I didn't get to eat before!

00:07:55.780 --> 00:08:01.000
Plain sugar, honey, chocolate sauce, marron cream...

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.350
Which one will you choose?

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.490
Umm...

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:04.850
The marron cream!

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:06.210
Sheesh, Ichigo!

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:12.960
The taste of chestnuts is dancing in my mouth!

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:14.980
And the taste of the crêpe is distinct, too...

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:17.430
It's completely different than the ones in Japan!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.680
You're a pretty funny girl, Ichigo.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:22.100
So happy...

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.070
So, Rick... Are you Italian?

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.150
Yes!

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.450
I'm currently studying abroad here in Paris.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.760
You came from Japan, right, Ichigo?

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:34.030
I love Japan!

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:36.190
Delicate, graceful, and mysterious!

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:37.420
Y-You think?

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:38.650
Yes, I do!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:41.240
I know lots of different things about Japan!

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:42.120
Why, you ask?

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.410
Amano!

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.920
Sorry!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.620
What happened, Amano-san?

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.500
You took so long, we were worried.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.920
You went and pigged out somewhere, right?

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.270
How did you know!?

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:56.770
You're completely predictable.

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:01.440
How rude you are to this fragile young lady.

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.430
I wouldn't say I'm <i>fragile...</i>

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.570
And who are you to be getting so close?

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.200
Let go of her now!

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.650
What a boor!

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:24.110
This all happened because you spaced out!

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.160
I said I was sorry!

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.290
So, who are you?

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.450
Rick's studying abroad from Italy.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:32.640
He helped me get back here.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:35.940
Well you're all set now that you've reunited with your friends, Ichigo.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:36.950
Until we meet again.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.460
Ciao!

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:42.180
Merci, Rick!

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:45.300
Playboy...

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.190
Whoa, what a jerk...

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:49.210
He sparkles like a star!

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.660
He's a match even for Hanabusa...

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:52.860
No, he may even surpass Satsuki!

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.530
But, there's something about him...

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:56.500
Yeah...

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:58.500
Look at the time!

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.250
The pre-competition party is going to begin!

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.870
Since you went on a pig-out spree, we weren't able to go anywhere!

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:06.460
I'm sorry!

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:10.210
St. Marie's main Paris campus.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.930
We're finally here.

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:12.710
Yup.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.350
It's even bigger than the Japan branch.

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:40.420
Look at all the pièces montées!

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:41.700
Wow...

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.510
It's more than just magnificent...

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:45.200
But it just piles on the pressure...

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:52.210
These are all St. Marie students that persevered from around the world!

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:54.600
If it isn't Ichigo!

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:57.310
Rick! Why are you here?

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:58.540
Don't tell me, you're...

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.980
I'm a representative from the main campus.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:03.500
And these are my teammates!

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:06.930
Eli, Clara, and...

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.330
Lemon-chan!

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:13.230
I knew you'd come to Paris, Ichigo-senpai!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:18.610
We may have lost to Tennouji-san in the finals, but they let us come as a special exception.

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:24.300
Oh, so then the older classmate who taught Lemon an important lesson is...

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:25.200
You, Ichigo?

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:26.290
Huh, say what?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:29.990
When I lost to you in that tournament, Ichigo-senpai...

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.920
That was the first time I took a second look at myself.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:37.340
I realised I should be honest and humble like you.

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:42.000
Humble!? I'm just a klutz...

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:47.870
It's all thanks to you that I'm able to participate in the World Cake Grand Prix!

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.680
Aw, you're flattering me...

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:52.410
Japanese people really are modest!

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.450
The representative from the main campus?

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:55.920
Despite being a total playboy!

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:58.110
I <i>really</i> don't want to lose to this guy.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:03.490
Hey... Looks like they're all living it up.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.530
That'll only last for today.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.950
Once the tournament starts, we're all rivals.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:15.500
To everyone who made it through the Cake Grand Prix from all around the world...

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:19.460
I welcome you to St. Marie Academy's main campus in Paris!

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:21.470
Henri-sensei!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.960
Today is the party on the eve of the World Cake Grand Prix!

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:28.720
Please, every team, enjoy yourself!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.260
Spirits?

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:34.850
Those are...

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:39.850
We have guests. Court Pâtissiers from the Kingdom of Sweets!

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:42.850
Now everyone, don't hide! Come out!

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:46.960
Those are the Court Pâtissiers...

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.770
...that we all look up to!

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:49.970
How wonderful...

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:50.870
Let's hurry and go!

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:03.760
Everyone is partnered with a Spirit...

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.850
A tournament board?

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:18.720
We will perform the draw for the tournament during the party.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:21.980
Wow!

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:24.490
What exactly does this...

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:30.480
All of you Spirits will work together in teams,

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.270
and will battle each other in various games.

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:35.240
Please do your best to clear them.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.060
However, magic is forbidden.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:42.250
The order you finish will determine the draw for the tournament.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.260
Then that means...

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.570
We're gonna be number one!

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:48.830
Yeah!

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:50.410
Let us give it everything we have!

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:51.190
Oui!

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:53.760
You can do it!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:56.450
Everyone on your marks...

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:57.260
Get set...

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.810
Start!

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:08.960
This is a...

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.310
...maze!?

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:12.460
Huh?

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:13.830
This is a dead-end!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.740
Which way is up?

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:17.830
I can't find the exit!

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.190
Oww!

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.180
It hurts.

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:22.700
Didn't we just pass through here?

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:24.080
Stay calm.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:28.400
If we look carefully at the structure of the Sweets Crafts, we should be able to find the exit.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.340
Oui!

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.840
We got out!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.560
What's this?

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.060
Let's go...

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:49.900
We have to hurry, too!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.190
I'm scared...

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:52.420
Have courage!

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:53.610
Let's go!

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:07.890
Ready, set...

